 58: pipd --root ./myproject compile-pi --intent <path to an intent card>
 59: pipd validate --bundle <path to the assembled bundle>
 60: # NOTE: --root is a GLOBAL option and must precede the subcommand. There is no --intent on
 61: # `intake` and no --root on `validate`; the CLI is deliberately strict and reports exactly what
 62: # it is missing (USAGE_INVALID / AUTHORITY_UNKNOWN) rather than guessing on your behalf.
 63: ```
